Subject: [PATCH 1451/3799] soh: rename func_808AC908 ->
 BgSpot02Objects_WaitForExplosion

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: the graveyard tombstone's idle: watches the cutscene for the actor cue that blows the royal tomb open, then plays the explosion sfx, sets the event flag and spawns the blast.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Spot02_Objects/z_bg_spot02_objects.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
