 .../Enhancements/TimeSavers/timesaver_hook_handlers.cpp    | 2 +-
 .../actors/ovl_Bg_Spot02_Objects/z_bg_spot02_objects.c     | 7 ++++---
 .../actors/ovl_Bg_Spot02_Objects/z_bg_spot02_objects.h     | 2 +-
 3 files changed, 6 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)

